# The Starcage exiles both players' Ornithopter on turn 5. Bot1 then casts its own Dauthi Voidwalker, whose replacement
# sends a card that would go to an opponent's graveyard to exile instead. On turn 9 the Starcage's second ability puts
# each exiled card into its owner's graveyard: Bot1's Ornithopter goes to Bot1's graveyard (Bot1 is no opponent of the
# Voidwalker's controller), Bot2's is exiled instead, so only one card was "put into a graveyard this way" and only
# one Robot is made (CR 614.1a, 607.2a). The Swamp in exile is Bot2's turn-8 discard to hand size, which the
# Voidwalker exiled too; the two Swamps in Bot2's graveyard are its earlier discards, before the Voidwalker came.

